OL,3,GNEWSA'Driving an F1 car for the first
OL,4,Atime is surreal'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRacing driver Jamie Chadwick has just
OL,7,Fjoined an elite club, becoming one of
OL,8,Fonly a dozen women to take the wheel of
OL,9,Fa Formula 1 car in an official
OL,10,Fcapacity.
OL,12,FThe 28-year-old driver, from Bath,
OL,13,Fcompleted 32 laps of testing in a
OL,14,FWilliams car around the Autodromo
OL,15,FInternacional do Algarve circuit in
OL,16,FPortugal on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
